* 35B-A3B Q8_0 `-ncmoe 48 -c 262144` q8_0 KV, 51 433-token prompt: arena 20 910 -> 23 715 MiB (residency
  64.1 -> 72.7 %), decode 111.2 -> 113.7 t/s at `-n 3000` (+2.2 %; +2.8-4.9 % at `-n 2000`), prefill +3.4 %,
  drafts byte-for-byte the same count (1995/3011) -- the window truncates nothing the drafter used.
* dense 27B UD-Q4_K_XL `-c 102400`, MTP Protocol A `-n 3000`, reasoning-pinned: layer 71.9 -> 72.1, tensor
  72.6 -> 72.5 (neutral), acceptance 2083/2747 identical in all four arms.
* target greedy text byte-identical across off/auto/4096, and plain == draft-mtp == draft-mtp(W=512) at
  `-c 16384` with a 5256-token prompt and 3000 generated tokens (10 158 chars, sha 99b267e8dc3e), i.e. no
