* gates on a windowed draft: `gate-park-idle-slots.sh` (35B, -ncmoe 48, `-c 65536`: 3 park moves, park ==
  lazyoff), `gate-ckpt-reuse.sh` (4B, `-c 131072`: draft cache 33280 of 131072), `gate-state-pipe.sh` (35B,
